# .syncignore - files dotfiles-sync never sends to, or takes from, the other repo.
#
# One gitignore-style pattern per line; a trailing "/" means a whole directory.
# Each repo keeps its own list (this file itself never syncs). Keep this side's
# private or machine-specific files here, e.g. ones only a personal Mac uses.
#
# Machine-specific settings belong in the local override files, which the shared
# configs load when present and which live outside this repo:
#   ~/.zshrc.local                   (sourced at the end of .zshrc)
#   ~/.config/tmux/local.conf        (sourced at the end of tmux.conf)
#   ~/profile.local.ps1              (dot-sourced at the end of profile.ps1)
# A repo that does track them (e.g. the work one) lists them here.
.config/gh/hosts.yml
.config/*-packages-windows.txt
